---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Releases - Strata">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="releases-page">
      <h1>Releases</h1>
      <p class="releases-intro">
        Current release and version history for Strata.
      </p>

      <div class="current-release">
        <div class="release-header">
          <h2>Current Release</h2>
          <span class="version-badge">Beta</span>
        </div>
        <p class="release-date">Last updated: 2026-07-20</p>
        
        <div class="release-notes">
          <h3>Release Notes</h3>
          <p>Strata is in active beta. Core systems are built and functional. This page tracks the current state of the release.</p>
          
          <h4>What's built</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Canvas: Infinite canvas, viewport culling, sticky snap, rulers, guides, view rotation, zoom range 0.001x-64x</li>
            <li>Vector tools: Shapes, pen/pencil with bezier handles, boolean operations, node editing, layers, groups, frames</li>
            <li>Typography: Multi-line text, OpenType features, variable fonts, text-on-path, inline editing, CJK line breaking</li>
            <li>Color and effects: RGB/CMYK color management, ICC profiles, blend modes, shadows, blur, adjustment layers, halftone</li>
            <li>Motion: Timeline animation, keyframes, easing, Smart Animate, prototype interactions, CSS/Lottie/video export</li>
            <li>Export: SVG, React/Tailwind, Flutter, SwiftUI, PDF with CMYK, PDF/X-1a and PDF/X-4, multi-page, facing pages</li>
            <li>Import: SVG, PDF, PSD, AI, EPS, and common image formats</li>
            <li>Design systems: Styles, variables, components, variants, libraries</li>
            <li>Background removal: AI-based with u2netp (bundled) and BiRefNet-Lite, hair edge refinement</li>
            <li>Workspace modes: Design, Print, Draw, Photo, Motion with per-mode toolbars and panels</li>
          </ul>
          
          <h4>Known limitations</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Complex script shaping (Arabic, Devanagari) not supported</li>
            <li>Collaboration features are UI scaffolding only</li>
            <li>Canvas bleed and trim visualization not implemented</li>
            <li>Background removal with BiRefNet-Lite requires native desktop (WASM has 4GB memory limit)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="previous-releases">
        <h2>Previous Releases</h2>
        <p>No previous releases. This is the initial development version.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="release-info">
        <h2>Release Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Version:</strong> 0.0.0 (development)</li>
          <li><strong>License:</strong> FSL-1.1-MIT</li>
          <li><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/K-Arthur/Strata">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><strong>Downloads:</strong> <a href="/download">Download page</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="release-cta">
        <h2>Download Current Release</h2>
        <a href="/download" class="btn-primary">Download Strata 0.0.0</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .releases-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }
  
  .releases-page h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .releases-intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .current-release {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-neutral-200);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .release-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .release-header h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .version-badge {
    background: var(--color-teal-600);
    color: white;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  .release-date {
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .release-notes h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .release-notes h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .release-notes ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .release-notes li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
  }
  
  .release-notes li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-teal-400);
  }
  
  .release-notes p {
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .previous-releases {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .previous-releases h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .previous-releases p {
    color: var(--color-neutral-600);
  }
  
  .release-info {
    background: var(--color-neutral-100);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  .release-info h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .release-info ul {
    list-style: none;
  }
  
  .release-info li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-700);
  }
  
  .release-info strong {
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
  
  .release-info a {
    color: var(--color-teal-600);
  }
  
  .release-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-neutral-200);
  }
  
  .release-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-neutral-900);
  }
</style>
